 had previous use of U-500R Kwikpen administration in the 9-month pre-index period;
 had ≥1 claim with an ICD-9/10-CM code (Appendix 1) for secondary diabetes, gestational diabetes, diabetes complicating pregnancy, childbirth, puerperium, or nonclinical diabetes at any time during the 9-month pre-index period;
